        <p><b>C·∫•u tr√∫c:</b> What's wrong? ‚Äî My + [b·ªô ph·∫≠n s·ªë √≠t] + hurts. V·ªõi s·ªë nhi·ªÅu: My + [b·ªô ph·∫≠n s·ªë nhi·ªÅu] + hurt.</p><p>My knee hurts. ‚Äî ƒê·∫ßu g·ªëi c·ªßa t√¥i b·ªã ƒëau. My stomach hurts a little. ‚Äî B·ª•ng c·ªßa t√¥i h∆°i ƒëau.</p>
