  </div>

  <!-- TAB 2: RULES & SENTENCES -->
  <div id="sentences" class="tab-content">
    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center; color: #2F855A; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.4rem;">Quy T·∫Øc Ng·ªØ Ph√°p & M·∫´u C√¢u</h2>
    <div class="sentence-section">

      <div class="sentence-card">
        <h3>üí° 1. M·∫°o T·ª´ "A" v√† "AN" (S·ªë √≠t - 1 qu·∫£)</h3>
        <p>‚Ä¢ <b>A:</b> ƒê·ª©ng tr∆∞·ªõc danh t·ª´ b·∫Øt ƒë·∫ßu b·∫±ng m·ªôt <b>Ph·ª• √¢m</b> (e.g. <i>a banana, a watermelon, a strawberry</i>).</p>
        <p>‚Ä¢ <b>AN:</b> ƒê·ª©ng tr∆∞·ªõc danh t·ª´ b·∫Øt ƒë·∫ßu b·∫±ng m·ªôt <b>Nguy√™n √¢m (A, E, I, O, U)</b> (e.g. <i>an apple, an orange, an avocado</i>).</p>
        <p>‚ûî M·∫´u c√¢u: <b>It is a/an + [T√™n qu·∫£]</b> (e.g. <i>It is an apple. / It is a banana.</i>)</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sentence-card">
        <h3>üí° 2. Quy T·∫Øc S·ªë Nhi·ªÅu & ƒê·∫øm S·ªë L∆∞·ª£ng (2 qu·∫£ tr·ªü l√™n)</h3>
        <p>Khi c√≥ t·ª´ 2 qu·∫£ tr·ªü l√™n, ta th√™m <b>-s</b>, <b>-es</b>, ho·∫∑c ƒë·ªïi <b>-y th√†nh -ies</b>:</p>
        <p>‚Ä¢ T·∫≠n c√πng th√¥ng th∆∞·ªùng: th√™m <b>-s</b> (e.g. <i>2 apples, 5 bananas, 10 oranges</i>).</p>
        <p>‚Ä¢ T·∫≠n c√πng -ch, -o: th√™m <b>-es</b> (e.g. <i>peach ‚ûî peaches, mango ‚ûî mangoes</i>).</p>
        <p>‚Ä¢ T·∫≠n c√πng ph·ª• √¢m + y: ƒë·ªïi th√†nh <b>-ies</b> (e.g. <i>strawberry ‚ûî strawberries, cherry ‚ûî cherries</i>).</p>
        <p>‚ûî M·∫´u c√¢u ƒë·∫øm s·ªë l∆∞·ª£ng: <b>There are [S·ªë l∆∞·ª£ng] [T√™n qu·∫£ s·ªë nhi·ªÅu]</b> (e.g. <i>There are 20 strawberries.</i>)</p>
      </div>

