          <p><span class="speaker">Tr·∫£ l·ªùi:</span> There are 20 apples. <button class="audio-btn" style="display:inline-flex; width:26px; height:26px; font-size:0.75rem;" onclick="speak('There are 20 apples.')">üîä</button></p>
        </div>
