    <p style="text-align: center; color: #718096; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 0.9rem;">Ch·∫°m v√†o th·∫ª ƒë·ªÉ l·∫≠t xem t√™n ti·∫øng Anh v√† nghe ph√°t √¢m!</p>

    <div class="single-card-container">
      <div class="card-controls">
        <span class="card-counter" id="card-counter-text">Th·∫ª 1 / 18</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flip-card-single" id="single-card-el" onclick="flipSingleCard()">
        <div class="flip-card-inner">
