<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>H·ªçc Ti·∫øng Anh Ch·ªß ƒê·ªÅ ƒê·ªông T·ª´ C∆° B·∫£n (Basic Verbs)</title>
<!-- Google Font: Nunito -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="./assets/css/topics/verbs.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="./assets/css/learning-shared.css?v=repo-picture-listen-20261025">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="./assets/css/grade2-theme.css?v=smooth-20261023-1">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../shared/grade-colors.css?v=all-grades-20261016-2">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="./assets/css/pencil-illustrations.css?v=picture-frame-20261023-2">
<script src="./assets/js/pencil-images-data.js?v=meaning-images-20261025"></script>
<script src="./assets/js/pencil-illustrations.js?v=compact-listen-20261024"></script>
<link data-grade2-letter rel="stylesheet" href="../../shared/learning-effects.css?v=site-letters-20261025">
<link data-grade2-letter rel="stylesheet" href="./assets/css/letter-ladder.css?v=site-letters-20261025"><link data-grade2-letter rel="stylesheet" href="./assets/css/picture-audio.css?v=picture-tap-20261024"><link rel="stylesheet" href="./assets/css/sentence-prompts.css?v=vi-first-20261025">
</head>
<body class="grade2-topic g2-pencil">

<header>
  <h1>üèÉ BASIC VERBS</h1>
  <p>H·ªçc T·ª´ V·ª±ng & M·∫´u C√¢u Ti·∫øng Anh Ch·ªß ƒê·ªÅ ƒê·ªông T·ª´ C∆° B·∫£n</p>
</header>

<nav>
  <button class="nav-btn active" onclick="switchTab('vocab', event)">üìö T·ª´ v·ª±ng ƒê·ªông T·ª´ C∆° B·∫£n</button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('sentences', event)">üó£Ô∏è M·∫´u C√¢u & C·∫•u Tr√∫c</button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('game-flip', event)">üÉè Game 1: L·∫≠t Flashcard</button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('game-mcq', event)">üéØ Game 2: Tr·∫Øc Nghi·ªám</button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('game-spelling', event)">‚úçÔ∏è Game 3: ƒêi·ªÅn Ch√≠nh T·∫£</button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('game-count', event)">üß© Game 4: Luy·ªán Vi·∫øt C√¢u Ho√†n Ch·ªânh</button>
</nav>

<div class="container">

  <!-- TAB 1: VOCABULARY -->
  <div id="vocab" class="tab-content active">
    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center; color: #D93838; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.4rem;">T·ª´ V·ª±ng ƒê·ªông T·ª´ C∆° B·∫£n</h2>
    <div class="vocab-grid" id="vocab-grid-container"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- TAB 2: RULES & SENTENCES -->
  <div id="sentences" class="tab-content">
    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center; color: #D93838; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.4rem;">M·∫´u C√¢u V·ªõi ƒê·ªông T·ª´: Kh·∫£ NƒÉng & M·ªánh L·ªánh</h2>
    <div class="sentence-section">

      <div class="sentence-card">
        <h3>üí° M·∫´u C√¢u 1: Di·ªÖn t·∫£ kh·∫£ nƒÉng (can + V)</h3>
        <p><b>Kh·∫≥ng ƒë·ªãnh:</b> S + can + V (nguy√™n th·ªÉ).</p>
        <p><i>V√≠ d·ª•: I can swim. (T√¥i c√≥ th·ªÉ b∆°i.)</i></p>
        <br>
        <p><b>Ph·ªß ƒë·ªãnh:</b> S + can't + V.</p>
        <p><i>V√≠ d·ª•: I can't fly. (T√¥i kh√¥ng th·ªÉ bay.)</i></p>
        <div class="dialogue">
          <p><span class="speaker">M·∫´u c√¢u:</span> I can run fast. <button class="audio-btn" style="display:inline-flex; width:28px; height:28px; font-size:0.75rem;" onclick="speak('I can run fast.')">üîä</button></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sentence-card">
        <h3>M·∫´u C√¢u 2: H·ªèi v·ªÅ kh·∫£ nƒÉng (What can you do? / Can you...?)</h3>
        <p><b>H·ªèi:</b> What can you do? (B·∫°n c√≥ th·ªÉ l√†m g√¨?)</p>
        <p><b>Tr·∫£ l·ªùi:</b> I can + V.</p>
        <p><b>H·ªèi Yes/No:</b> Can you swim? &nbsp;‚Üí&nbsp; <b>Tr·∫£ l·ªùi:</b> Yes, I can. / No, I can't.</p>
        <div class="dialogue">
          <p><span class="speaker">Ask:</span> Can you swim? <button class="audio-btn" style="display:inline-flex; width:28px; height:28px; font-size:0.75rem;" onclick="speak('Can you swim?')">üîä</button></p>
          <p><span class="speaker">Answer:</span> Yes, I can. I can swim well. <button class="audio-btn" style="display:inline-flex; width:28px; height:28px; font-size:0.75rem;" onclick="speak('Yes, I can. I can swim well.')">üîä</button></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sentence-card">
        <h3>M·∫´u C√¢u 3: C√¢u m·ªánh l·ªánh (Imperative sentences)</h3>
        <p><b>Kh·∫≥ng ƒë·ªãnh:</b> V (nguy√™n th·ªÉ) + ...!</p>
        <p><i>V√≠ d·ª•: Stand up! (ƒê·ª©ng l√™n!)</i></p>
        <br>
        <p><b>Ph·ªß ƒë·ªãnh:</b> Don't + V + ...!</p>
