      ['doctor|b√°c sƒ©|doctor','teacher|gi√°o vi√™n|teacher','farmer|n√¥ng d√¢n|farmer','driver|ng∆∞·ªùi l√°i xe|drive'],
      ['B·ªë m√¨nh l√† b√°c sƒ©.|My father is a doctor.','B·∫°n bao nhi√™u tu·ªïi?|How old are you?','M√¨nh t√°m tu·ªïi.|I am eight years old.']],
