      ['bedroom|ph√≤ng ng·ªß|bedroom','living room|ph√≤ng kh√°ch|living-room','kitchen|nh√† b·∫øp|kitchen','bathroom|ph√≤ng t·∫Øm|bathroom','garden|khu v∆∞·ªùn|garden'],
      ['ƒê√¢y l√† ph√≤ng ng·ªß.|This is the bedroom.','Nh√† b·∫øp ·ªü ƒë√¢u?|Where is the kitchen?','Khu v∆∞·ªùn nh·ªè.|The garden is small.']],
