      ['Quy·ªÉn s√°ch ·ªü tr√™n b√†n.|The book is on the table.','Qu·∫£ b√≥ng ·ªü d∆∞·ªõi gi∆∞·ªùng.|The ball is under the bed.','C√°i b√∫t ·ªü trong h·ªôp.|The pen is in the box.']],
    ['At the dining table','B·ªØa ƒÉn c√πng gia ƒë√¨nh','üçΩÔ∏è','M·ªùi v√† xin ƒë·ªì ƒÉn, th·ª©c u·ªëng.',
      ['water|n∆∞·ªõc|water','juice|n∆∞·ªõc √©p|juice','rice|c∆°m|üçö','bread|b√°nh m√¨|üçû','milk|s·ªØa|ü•õ','fish|c√°|üêü'],
      ['M√¨nh mu·ªën m·ªôt √≠t n∆∞·ªõc.|I would like some water.','Em c√≥ th·ªÉ l·∫•y m·ªôt √≠t c∆°m kh√¥ng?|May I have some rice?','M√¨nh th√≠ch s·ªØa.|I like milk.']],
    ['My pets','Th√∫ c∆∞ng c·ªßa m√¨nh','üêà','N√≥i v·ªÅ v·∫≠t nu√¥i m√¨nh c√≥.',
      ['cat|con m√®o|kitten','dog|con ch√≥|üêï','bird|con chim|üê¶','fish|con c√°|üêü'],
      ['M√¨nh c√≥ m·ªôt con m√®o.|I have a cat.','B·∫°n c√≥ ch√≥ kh√¥ng?|Do you have a dog?','M√¨nh c√≥ hai con chim.|I have two birds.']],
    ['Our toys','ƒê·ªì ch∆°i c·ªßa ch√∫ng m√¨nh','ü™Å','G·ªçi t√™n v√† h·ªèi v·ªÅ ƒë·ªì ch∆°i.',
      ['kite|di·ªÅu|kite','ball|qu·∫£ b√≥ng|‚öΩ','doll|b√∫p b√™|ü™Ü','car|√¥ t√¥ ƒë·ªì ch∆°i|üöó'],
      ['M√¨nh c√≥ m·ªôt c√°i di·ªÅu.|I have a kite.','B·∫°n c√≥ bao nhi√™u √¥ t√¥ ƒë·ªì ch∆°i?|How many cars do you have?','M√¨nh c√≥ hai qu·∫£ b√≥ng.|I have two balls.']],
